-
-    <div class="flow-steps">
-      <div class="flow-step">
-        <span class="flow-dot code"></span>
-        <div class="flow-text"><b>Poller checks Twilio</b> — no webhook. A script asks Twilio's API "anything new?" on an interval, deliberately avoiding a webhook so it never conflicts with other apps sharing the number. <span>app/poll_inbound.py</span></div>
-      </div>
-      <div class="flow-step">
-        <span class="flow-dot agent"></span>
